                            	   772: ; Runtime title balance removed in favor of the static frontend hardware
                            	   773: ; palette table below. Keeping lookup-only sync preserves v659-style timing.
                            	   774: 
                            	   775: ; Accurate NES 2C02 NTSC palette → Genesis $0BGR (3-bit per channel)
                            	   776: ; Lift each nonzero channel one 3-bit step until the top band to compensate
                            	   777: ; for darker BizHawk/console output without runtime title tint math.
